    "text": "Mistral Medium 3.1 is a multimodal language model from Mistral AI that takes text and image input and returns text, released on 12 August 2025 on Mistral's API under the commercial Premier licence category. Mistral described it as an update with improved tone and performance; it was retired on 31 August 2026, with Mistral Medium 3.5 named as the replacement.",
